    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan calls her Attitude Gu a rank eight Immortal Gu and says anyone with a thinking mind can wear it and use it, naming it a legendary Gu worm recorded in The Legends of Ren Zu. She says the requirements to use it are minimal: it does not need immortal essence and only consumes mental energy, so even she as a rank six Gu Immortal can use this rank eight Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          974
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-and-wear",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Attitude Gu’s appearance is like a mask. Ren Zu puts it on his face, but he cannot wear it. Even tied with a rope, it still falls off.",
        "chapters": [
          87
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Attitude Gu at rank eight is the sole core of familiar face. Besides Attitude Gu, familiar face has over twenty supplementary Gu, among them two Immortal Gu including change form Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          976
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sole-core-among-the-move",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_change_form_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Disguised as Huang Sha to join Yi Tian Village early, Fang Yuan uses an immortal killer move with attitude Gu as its core, familiar face, to keep from being exposed by the Southern Border Gu Immortals there.",
        "chapters": [
          998
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "first-use-disguised-as-huang-sha",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_yi_tian_village",
          "reg_southern_border"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s acting with Attitude Gu makes Lang Ya land spirit believe he is speaking the truth, sincere and apologetic.",
        "chapters": [
          1134
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "used-against-lang-ya-land-spirit",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "During a Southern Border banquet, Fang Yuan uses Attitude Gu again as he praises Chi Shang, and Chi Shang’s suspicion that he might be acting fades even as he tries to stay alert to being played.",
        "chapters": [
          1331
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "used-on-chi-shang",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chi_shang"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the same green heaven stretch that gives freedom Gu its origin, Ren Zu wears attitude Gu’s mask to feign warmth and draw hungry feathermen into his house, then takes it off once the timing is ripe, revealing his true, cold expression, and lets them starve.",
        "chapters": [
          870
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feigned-warmth-for-the-feathermen",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_freedom_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Planning attitude Gu’s feeding, the text calls it worthy of being a legendary Immortal Gu recorded in The Legends of Ren Zu, since even though it is rank eight, it can be activated on mental energy and freely used by a rank six Gu Immortal like Fang Yuan. The chapter also states that attitude Gu feeds on flowing light fruits in enormous quantity at long intervals, that Hei Lou Lan’s will is still inside it though some of the information path restrictions on Fang Yuan should have been broken, and that Fang Yuan sets the plan of refining it into his own aside for the moment because wisdom Gu does not acknowledge him, so he cannot use the light of wisdom to arrange the wisdom refinement formation it would take.",
        "chapters": [
          1083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding-plan-and-the-refinement-set-aside",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wisdom_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Feeding it is one of Fang Yuan’s two unresolved problems among his rank eight Immortal Gu, alongside Wisdom Sword.",
        "chapters": [
          1291
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding-difficulty",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wisdom_sword_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
