  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Jia Fu continues a Ren Zu stretch after Rules and Regulation Gu have given Ren Zu strength and cost him wisdom. Ren Zu will not free the leftover Gu in the net, so they bet that once the net opens they will flee in three directions, and that only the Gu he captures will submit. Jia Fu’s aide guesses Ren Zu captures Attitude Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          59
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_jia_fu",
          "gu_rules_and_regulation_gu",
          "char_ren_zu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit names the legendary Attitude Gu as the core Gu of the immortal killer move familiar face when he offers Fang Yuan the related mortal killer move unfamiliar face.",
        "chapters": [
          709
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "familiar-face-core",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness says the Gu was once in Hei Fan’s hands; he gave it to his granddaughter Hei Feng Yue, who as a mortal brought the Immortal Gu onto the icy plain, was targeted by a mysterious Gu Immortal, and vanished with Attitude Gu. Hei Lou Lan says she obtained Attitude Gu from the icy plain, and that she went there for immortal ascension because she had clues to its whereabouts, subduing it by borrowing the heavenly might of the tribulation.",
        "chapters": [
          948
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "icy-plain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
          "char_hei_fan",
          "char_lady_earth_mother",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After swapping souls with Ying Wu Xie, Fang Yuan realizes attitude Gu let him disguise himself and deceive Ying Wu Xie’s will that sits inside the dream path Immortal Gu and mortal Gu now in his hands, the same trick he used earlier to coax Immortal Gu out of Bo Qing’s immortal zombie body with Mo Yao’s fake will.",
        "chapters": [
          1019
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "disguise-inside-borrowed-gu-worms",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ying_wu_xie",
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "char_bo_qing",
          "char_mo_yao"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Inspecting the Gu worms he regained control of after using Change Soul, Fang Yuan finds the highest-ranking among them is the legendary attitude Immortal Gu, alongside the wisdom path Unravel Mystery and the soul path Change Soul.",
        "chapters": [
          1023
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "highest-ranking-gu-after-the-swap",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_change_soul_immortal_gu",
          "gu_unravel_mystery"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Having deceived Huo Kong Dong using attitude Gu alone, Fang Yuan reflects that although attitude Gu is of high rank, it has a low usage requirement and only expends mental energy, which matters because he has just revived and has little immortal essence, far less than his original accumulation.",
        "chapters": [
          1025
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "low-usage-requirement-despite-high-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_huo_kong_dong"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Killing Qi Zai with a disguised version of familiar face, the text confirms that even without change form Immortal Gu the killer move’s core is still rank eight attitude Gu, which influences the minds of others, letting them feel Fang Yuan’s ‘attitude’ and lowering their suspicions.",
        "chapters": [
          1043
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "influencing-minds-as-familiar-faces-core",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_qi_zai"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After bluffing the variant human Gu Immortals that he is a Lang Ya Sect supreme elder on their side and placing the upper extreme heavenly eagle inside his immortal aperture as a show of sincerity, Fang Yuan himself offers to stay and notify Lang Ya Sect and feigns a joyful attitude; with his acting joined to attitude Gu, the text states there is no flaw in it at all, and the variant human Gu Immortals notice none.",
        "chapters": [
          1142
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "no-flaw-in-his-feigned-joy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_lang_ya_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While Fang Yuan spends the following days drawing Chi Shang closer, narration credits his scheming and his possession of Attitude Gu for Chi Shang being no match for him.",
        "chapters": [
          1333
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-edge-over-chi-shang",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
